    <string name="walking_places_help">On foot, also tell about the town you enter and the town hall, churches, museums and listed buildings you pass, from OpenStreetMap and Wikidata.</string>
    <string name="translate_places">Translate places without an article in %1$s</string>
    <string name="translate_places_help">Also tell about places only the Wikipedia of the country you\'re in, or the English one, knows, translated on the phone. The first time per language this downloads about 30 MB.</string>
