    <string name="credits">Stories come from Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0), and for buildings from OpenStreetMap (ODbL) and Wikidata (CC0). Map © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Roads, railways and buildings: Overpass API. Routing: OSRM (routing.openstreetmap.de, FOSSGIS) and Nominatim. Voices: Kokoro (Apache 2.0) and Piper models run with sherpa-onnx (Apache 2.0). No AI service is used while guiding, unless you choose Gemini Nano or Claude as the storyteller, or an ElevenLabs voice.</string>
