    <string name="storyteller">Storyteller</string>
    <string name="storyteller_builtin_help">Tells passages of the Wikipedia article as they are written. Free, instant and works everywhere, but it can\'t retell: a story is only as well told as the article.</string>
    <string name="storyteller_nano_help">Retells each story on the phone itself, through Android AICore. Free and private, but only on some recent phones (e.g. Pixel 9 and later), and plainer than Claude.</string>
