    <string name="storyteller_open_help">Retells each story with a small open model that the app runs itself. Free and private on any recent phone, but it needs a download of about 1 GB, is slow on mid-range phones and less accurate. Experimental.</string>
    <string name="storyteller_claude_help">Retells each story the way a good guide would: the best told stories. Needs your own Anthropic API key and a connection. Anthropic bills you per story, a place is paid for only once, and a monthly budget caps the cost.</string>
