    <string name="nav_notifications">Navigation notifications (optional)</string>
    <string name="nav_notifications_help">With notification access, the guide follows Google Maps, Komoot, Garmin, OsmAnd or Waze live: it reads the next instruction (\"in 300 m turn left onto …\") and follows the road through that turn, without sharing anything. It only looks at those apps\' notifications and never stores or sends them anywhere. Notifications only tell the next turn, so a shared route still looks further ahead.</string>
